# {{NAME}}

Local adOmnia extension generated from the `request-hook` template.

The package declares response-read access. Review `docs/EVENTS.md` and `docs/PERMISSIONS.md` in the exported SDK before implementing response handling.

```bash
adomnia extension check . --json
adomnia extension pack . --json
```

Extension Platform v2 is currently a preview contract. Validation and packaging are available before runtime activation ships.
